				\begin{document}$$ \mathrm{Cell}\ \mathrm{viability}=\left(\mathrm{A}\ \mathrm{sample}/\mathrm{A}\ \mathrm{control}\right)\times 100\% $$\end{document}Cell viability=Asample/Acontrol×100%

